      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FIGURE OF SPEECH (8) was well off top last time, finishing 7th (22.73) in a Grade 4/5 at Shepparton. Has won here at this journey. Has ability and looks hard to stop. HOPE JUAN (7) was narrowly beaten when placing two back but missed the frame latest finishing fifth (26.00) in a Grade 5 at Warrnambool. Expecting significant improvement this line-up. RED TURTLE (2) scored two back in quick then drifted back and missed the frame latest finishing a 6 length 4th at this track (24.46). Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings two times from four attempts. Should be about the money. JODIE'S ANGEL (1) can measure up with the right run.",
